<title>USA: Hercules adds funds for shr buyback plan.</title>
<headline>Hercules adds funds for shr buyback plan.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del. 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hercules Inc said Monday that it has decided to continue its ongoing share repurchase program using procceds from the sale of its Tastemaker food flavoring joint venture, unless a more attractive investment appears.</p>
<p>Earlier, the company had indicated its intention to allocate only $50 million of the $550 million net proceeds from the Tastemaker transaction for share repurchase .</p>
<p>A company spokeswoman declined to elaborate.</p>
</text>
